{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race, build, and share!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across an ever-growing collection of challenges and missions, unlock tons of cars, and explore user-generated maps. Build your own worlds and tracks with the powerful, easy-to-use World Editor. Share your creations with the community and prove your skills on our global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.poster.avif?t=1768153340\" width=674 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.webm?t=1768153340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.mp4?t=1768153340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Driving Styles</strong>: Hand-made physics give each car its own personality and handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions and Challenges:</strong> Beat the clock, unlock new cars, and collect trophies across a variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Editor</strong>: Create vast cities or tight circuits, from snowy landscapes to deserts. Your imagination is the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/b6e3b0450b6290445a1f5205001116aa.poster.avif?t=1768153340\" width=674 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/b6e3b0450b6290445a1f5205001116aa.webm?t=1768153340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/b6e3b0450b6290445a1f5205001116aa.mp4?t=1768153340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Sharing</strong>: Share your maps and explore cities made by others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi Challenges</strong>: Pick up and drop off passengers in this fun mini game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Bar/Gas Mode</strong>: Survive tricky routes with limited health and gas. Challenge your driving precision under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Chase Mode</strong>: Outrun the police and don\u2019t get caught!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Spot Mode</strong>: Drive as the world builds in real-time. Can you react fast enough?\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer</strong>: Race against friends and rivals. Even if they\u2019re offline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Progression</strong>: Climb the ranks, unlock new cars, and expand your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Watch your city come alive with dynamic lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Traffic System</strong>: Bring your maps to life with reactive traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Unlockables</strong>: Unlock new cars and assets, with continuous updates coming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more coming!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1 Bronze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/